<view class="rewards-page">
  <view class="rewards-heading"><text class="rewards-eyebrow">一点点，收集坚持</text><view class="rewards-title-row"><text class="rewards-title">松果与勋章</text><text class="rewards-demo-label">开发演示</text></view></view>
  <view class="forest-wallet">
    <view class="wallet-orbit wallet-orbit-one"></view><view class="wallet-orbit wallet-orbit-two"></view>
    <view class="wallet-copy">
      <view class="wallet-label"><image src="{{brand.pinecone}}" aria-hidden="true"/><text>我的松果</text></view>
      <view class="wallet-balance"><text>{{pine}}</text><text class="wallet-unit">颗</text></view>
      <text class="wallet-today">今天已收集 {{gotToday}} 颗</text>
    </view>
    <image class="wallet-mascot" src="/assets/brand/xiaozhi-mascot-v1.png" mode="aspectFit" aria-label="小枝抱着松果"/>
    <view class="wallet-caption"><view class="wallet-dot"></view><text>每一颗，都是一份小小的坚持</text></view>
  </view>

  <view class="reward-section-heading"><text>今天的松果</text><text class="section-caption">慢慢积累就很好</text></view>
  <view class="reward-card reward-tasks">
    <view wx:for="{{tasks}}" wx:for-item="task" wx:key="_k" class="reward-task">
      <view class="reward-task-main"><text class="reward-task-title">{{task.name}}</text><text class="reward-task-detail">{{task.detail}}</text></view>
      <view class="reward-points"><image src="{{brand.pinecone}}" aria-hidden="true"/><text>{{task.pts}}</text></view>
      <text class="reward-task-state {{task.isDone ? 'task-earned' : task.state === '复查后' ? 'task-later' : 'task-pending'}}">{{task.state}}</text>
    </view>
    <text class="rewards-note">支具和训练分开记录，一项没做到不影响另一项。</text>
  </view>

  <view class="reward-section-heading medal-heading"><text>我的勋章</text><text class="section-caption">只看坚持，不看度数</text></view>
  <view class="medal-grid">
    <view wx:for="{{medals}}" wx:for-item="medal" wx:key="_k" class="medal-card {{medal.earned ? 'medal-earned' : 'medal-growing'}}">
      <view class="medal-emblem">
        <view class="medal-ribbon"></view>
        <view class="medal-face"><image src="{{medal.icon}}" mode="aspectFit" aria-hidden="true"/></view>
        <view wx:if="{{medal.earned}}" class="medal-seal">✓</view>
      </view>
      <text class="medal-name">{{medal.name}}</text>
      <text class="medal-state">{{medal.earned ? '已获得' : medal.badge}}</text>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="reward-card backfill-card">
    <view class="backfill-icon"><image src="{{brand.calendar}}" aria-hidden="true"/></view>
    <view class="backfill-copy"><text class="reward-task-title">补记真实训练</text><text class="reward-task-detail">选择实际日期，记下完成量</text></view>
    <button class="backfill-button" bindtap="act" data-fn="{{doMakeup}}">去补记 ›</button>
  </view>
</view>
